{"articleNo":"1485","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1485&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 1학기 금오공과대학교 교수초빙 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.11.15","hit":"11482","attachments":[{"name":"2. 분야별 세부평가기준.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1485&attachNo=69534"},{"name":"1. 2011학년도 1학기 교수초빙 공고문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1485&attachNo=71172"},{"name":"3. 금오공과대학교교육공무원임용규정.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1485&attachNo=71199"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">▣2011학년도 1학기 교수초빙 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">창의와 도전정신을 바탕으로 연구와 교육분야에 있어 선도적으로 이끌어 갈 유능한 교수님을 모시고자 합니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">1. 채용분야 및 인원 : 총 2개 분야 / 2명</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">2. 접수 기간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 인터넷 접수 : 2010.11. 29(월) ~12. 6(월) 09:00 ~ 18:00 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">서류접수 : 2010.12. 2(목) ~ 12. 6(월) 09:00 ~18:00<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (인터넷 접수자에 한함) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 한국시간 기준이며 토ㆍ일요일 제외</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">3. 접수처 및 주소&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 접수처 : 금오공과대학교 교무연구과 교수지원팀(글로벌관 4층 434호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">주 소</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">730-701 경북 구미시 양호동 1번지 금오공과대학교 교무연구과(교수지원팀)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 16.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -16.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">4. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">기타 상세한 사항은&nbsp; 붙임 초빙 공고문 등과 교수초빙 홈페이지를 통해 확인하시고, 문의사항은 본교 교무연구과 교수지원팀으로 하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 교수채용 담당자 연락처 : 전화 (054)478-7025 / 팩스 (054)478-7034</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">교수초빙 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://kitin.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">http://kitin.kumoh.ac.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;붙임 1. 교수초빙 공고문</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 세부평가기준 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 본교 교육공무원 임용규정 등&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
